  "name": "Songs of Tagore, In Data (Swaralipi Corpus)",
  "alternateName": "গান, ডেটায়",
  "description": "Thirty Rabindrasangeet digitized from akarmatrik swaralipi into an open symbolic notation format — swara, saptak, matra-fraction timing, taal cycles across twenty taal families, and Bengali lyric alignment — with derived MIDI and MusicXML, notation-synthesized audio, per-song provenance and confidence, and a blind AI-continuation experiment. To our knowledge the first openly licensed machine-readable corpus of Rabindrasangeet notation.",
  "url": "https://github.com/indranilbanerjee/tagore-swaralipi",
