  "measurementTechnique": "Re-encoded from the SNLTR digital edition of Swarabitan; three songs additionally verified matra-by-matra against scans of the printed Swarabitan (Visva-Bharati). Taal assignments are cross-checked against the bar structure printed in the notation itself."
